sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Voter as Voter (Browser)
    participant Server as SecureVote Server
    participant Liveness as Active Liveness Engine
    participant BlindSigner as Chaum RSA Signer
    participant DB as SQLite DB

    Note over Voter,Server: Election Phase = OPEN (Wall-clock >= T_open)
    Voter->>Server: GET /api/voters/share_b/{voter_id}
    Server->>Server: Verify Election Status == OPEN
    Server->>DB: Decrypt Share B using K_timelock
    Server-->>Voter: Return { share_b: Share B }

    Voter->>Voter: Reconstruct Secret S' = (Share A + Share B) mod Q
    Voter->>Voter: Generate 256-bit Random Token Nonce N_token
    Voter->>Voter: Blind Nonce: m' = (N_token * r^e) mod N_rsa

    Voter->>Voter: Complete Liveness Challenge (Blink + Head Turn)
    Voter->>Server: POST /api/auth/blind-token { voter_id, share_a, share_b, blinded_token: m', liveness_telemetry }
    Server->>Server: Verify SHA256(Share A + Share B) == Stored Commitment C
    Server->>Liveness: Verify EAR < 0.22 (Blink) & Yaw < -8.0 deg (Turn)
    Server->>Server: Check Voter Has Not Received Blind Signature
    Server->>BlindSigner: Sign Blinded Token: s' = (m')^d mod N_rsa
    Server->>DB: Mark voter_id as TOKEN_ISSUED
    Server-->>Voter: Return { blind_signature: s' }

    Voter->>Voter: Unblind Signature: s = (s' * r^(-1)) mod N_rsa
    Note over Voter: Voter now possesses valid pair (N_token, s) unlinked to voter_id
